    "body": "Pushed c5cce564 for the review's blocker. `floor_at` now refuses when the swept tool came within one cell of any centre in the 3×3×3 block around the floor point, so the near-wall points and sub-cell cuts are caught (conservatively). It's pinned by `a_point_inside_a_cut_near_its_wall_is_refused_too`, which covers the review's own repro: y 3.81, 3.9, 3.99, 4.01, 6.0, 8.1 and 8.19 inside an r 2.2 slot. The docs now say \"exact to rounding\". Re-ran: field_floor 3, field_carry 3, stock_backend_parity 13, stock_columns 3. Clippy is clean. Ready again.",
